{"version": 2, "width": 120, "height": 35, "timestamp": 1782422260, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": null}, "title": "EST Enrollment (RFC 7030) — Post-Quantum PKI"}
[0.00916, "o", "=== EST Enrollment (RFC 7030) — PQ Hierarchy ===\r\n\r\nFetching CA certificates from EST endpoint...\r\n"]
[0.215194, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36mEST CA Certificates\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.215259, "o", "  PKI:      PQC\r\n"]
[0.215646, "o", "  Endpoint: \u001b[4;94mhttps://pq-est-ca.cert-lab.local:8456/.well-known/est/cacerts\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.215726, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.215858, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.217233, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Fetching CA certificates..."]
[0.295294, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Fetching CA certificates...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[0.296055, "o", "\u001b[31m✗ Failed to get CA certificates\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.296269, "o", "  Error: Failed to connect to EST endpoint: Connection refused\r\n"]
[0.296717, "o", "  \u001b[33mHint: Ensure EST CA is running and EST is enabled\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.344027, "o", "\r\nEnrolling via EST simpleenroll...\r\n"]
[0.669485, "o", "\u001b[33mUsage: \u001b[0m\u001b[1;32m-c\u001b[0m est-enroll [OPTIONS]\r\n"]
[0.670026, "o", "\u001b[2mTry \u001b[0m\u001b[2;34m'\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;34m-c\u001b[0m\u001b[2;34m est-enroll \u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;34m-\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;34m-help\u001b[0m\u001b[2;34m'\u001b[0m\u001b[2m for help.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.670741, "o", "\u001b[31m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[31m Error \u001b[0m\u001b[31m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[31m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m│\u001b[0m No such option: \u001b[1;36m-\u001b[0m\u001b[1;36m-cn\u001b[0m ('(Possible options: \u001b[1;36m-\u001b[0m\u001b[1;36m-cert\u001b[0m)',)                                                                 \u001b[31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[31m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
